A '''Theelin-human hybrid'''<ref name="Geektionary">''[[Star Wars: Geektionary: The Galaxy from A - Z]]''</ref> was a [[Sentience|sentient]]<ref name="Episode VI" /> [[hybrid]] [[species]] that consisted of an individual that was both [[Theelin]] and [[human]]. The [[Max Rebo Band]] dancer [[Rystáll Sant]] was one such individual who was a Theelin-human hybrid,<ref name="Geektionary" /> as was [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Jecki Lon]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Interview">{{SW|url=news/leslye-headland-interview|text="Whatever You Think ''The Acolyte'' Is, It's Not": ''Star Wars'' Series Creator Leslye Headland Revels in the First Teaser Trailer}}</ref>

